\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {23}{\ignorespaces Extended Agentic SABRE+ pipeline. Three modality-specific agents (Semantic, Behavioural, Knowledge CNNs) produce mean-uncertainty pairs via Monte Carlo Dropout. The Peer Consultation module adjusts uncertain agents' probabilities before score fusion. The Decision MLP, calibrated by temperature scaling, produces the fused risk $\hat  {p}$. The Triage Policy routes each sample to AUTO-CONTAIN, ESCALATE, or ALLOW. The Expert Feedback Loop closes the human-in-the-loop cycle.}}{99}{figure.6.23}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:tifs_pipeline}{{23}{99}{Extended Agentic SABRE+ pipeline. Three modality-specific agents (Semantic, Behavioural, Knowledge CNNs) produce mean-uncertainty pairs via Monte Carlo Dropout. The Peer Consultation module adjusts uncertain agents' probabilities before score fusion. The Decision MLP, calibrated by temperature scaling, produces the fused risk $\hat {p}$. The Triage Policy routes each sample to AUTO-CONTAIN, ESCALATE, or ALLOW. The Expert Feedback Loop closes the human-in-the-loop cycle}{figure.6.23}{}}
